WEBVTT

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:38.000
=Episode 2=

00:01:38.459 --> 00:01:40.459
I heard your wife's elder brother

00:01:40.739 --> 00:01:42.099
Holds office in Tong County.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.500
Would you

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.099
Write me a letter

00:01:45.099 --> 00:01:45.980
Of recommendation

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.420
And have him vouch for me?

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:50.340
(My)

00:01:50.819 --> 00:01:51.620
(brother-in-law?)

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.620
Would it be out of line?

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.259
This young lady

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:10.220
Is of the Fu family.

00:02:10.659 --> 00:02:12.259
Sir, would you read her Eight Characters?

00:02:12.419 --> 00:02:14.659
Will she bring me good fortune

00:02:14.659 --> 00:02:15.500
And bless me with sons?

00:02:17.579 --> 00:02:18.940
Can she lend me support

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:19.699
For my imperial exams?

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:21.859
Without her exact hour of birth,

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.340
I cannot read your marriage compatibility.

00:02:24.259 --> 00:02:26.419
I suspect you have not obtained her family's consent

00:02:26.659 --> 00:02:28.139
(Zuo Junjie & Fu Tingyun) and sought this divination in secret.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.856
(Zuo Junjie, Madam Zuo's younger brother)

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.340
(Scoundrel.)

00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:36.020
They speak of

00:02:37.139 --> 00:02:38.900
The Ninth Young Lady, do they not?

00:02:40.539 --> 00:02:41.940
Mr. Zhao, please do not misunderstand.

00:02:42.139 --> 00:02:43.500
This man is nothing but a rogue.

00:02:44.139 --> 00:02:44.859
Tingyun

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.780
Has never been betrothed to anyone.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.460
Don't get so worked up.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:51.460
Listen.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.060
She was born

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.379
Around the 18th day of the 4th month, Fifth Year of Dacheng.

00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:56.740
On that day,

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.500
All the magnolias in our home bloomed.

00:03:00.139 --> 00:03:00.819
Sir,

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:01.740
Please check it for me.

00:03:01.859 --> 00:03:02.900
This...

00:03:03.419 --> 00:03:03.940
Forget it.

00:03:04.139 --> 00:03:05.419
Sir, examine mine first instead.

00:03:06.099 --> 00:03:07.940
You have a fine nose.

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:08.940
In years to come,

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.900
You are destined for a high official post.

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:12.379
Sir,

00:03:12.699 --> 00:03:13.900
I've known since childhood

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:15.180
That I am bound for high office.

00:03:15.539 --> 00:03:16.099
Someday,

00:03:16.259 --> 00:03:17.419
Once I attain high office,

00:03:17.539 --> 00:03:18.979
I shall give you a shop.

00:03:19.379 --> 00:03:20.259
Splendid.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.460
Farewell.

00:03:51.539 --> 00:03:52.419
Who are you?

00:03:52.419 --> 00:03:52.900
How dare you

00:03:52.979 --> 00:03:53.740
Strike me!

00:03:53.979 --> 00:03:55.220
I am Zuo, a scholar!

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:55.579
Take this!

00:03:55.579 --> 00:03:56.900
I am Zuo, a scholar!

00:03:57.379 --> 00:03:58.379
My elder sister

00:03:58.659 --> 00:04:01.060
Is the daughter-in-law of the Magistrate's elder brother!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.300
Stop hitting me!

00:04:18.899 --> 00:04:19.660
He's still alive.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.219
Come.

00:04:26.459 --> 00:04:27.620
Many thanks, Mr. Zhao,

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:29.540
For helping me settle the score.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.420
Indeed.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.139
Here.

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:35.139
No need for small cups.

00:04:35.819 --> 00:04:36.940
I'll drain an entire pot.

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:42.459
Tingzhuo,

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:45.219
Earlier you said something

00:04:46.139 --> 00:04:47.219
About Tong County,

00:04:48.459 --> 00:04:49.860
And my elder brother-in-law?

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.819
What brother-in-law?

00:04:54.139 --> 00:04:55.819
I don't recall.

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:01.779
Wait a moment.

00:05:05.379 --> 00:05:06.740
You...

00:05:11.259 --> 00:05:11.980
From now on,

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.339
I'll be your elder brother-in-law.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:19.860
Look at the Fu family,

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.620
A house full of hollow lotus roots.

00:05:23.019 --> 00:05:25.100
How could they produce such a genuine soul?

00:05:31.019 --> 00:05:31.899
If you ask me,

00:05:32.219 --> 00:05:33.940
Let's settle this marriage, then.

00:05:34.699 --> 00:05:36.459
The dowry we swindle over

00:05:37.259 --> 00:05:38.139
Can serve as salt trade capital,

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.540
And we'll gain a sister-in-law to boot.

00:05:41.819 --> 00:05:42.940
Mark my words.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.219
We agreed we're only after money.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.259
Don't even think about tricking her into marriage.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.300
Look at us right now,

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.139
Living hand to mouth.

00:05:55.779 --> 00:05:56.699
We have no right to ruin

00:05:56.699 --> 00:05:58.060
An innocent young lady.

00:05:58.940 --> 00:05:59.860
Look at yourself.

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:01.339
You are no longer young,

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.620
Yet still unwed.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:04.699
I just fear...

00:06:07.779 --> 00:06:09.459
I fear if I meet someone

00:06:14.019 --> 00:06:15.259
From a household like the Fu family,

00:06:15.699 --> 00:06:17.899
Where everyone plots and schemes all day long,

00:06:18.139 --> 00:06:19.660
Weighing pros and cons in every matter,

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:20.779
Haggling over gains and losses,

00:06:21.139 --> 00:06:22.620
Calculating how much dowry she'll bring,

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.139
And how much betrothal gifts I must offer.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:26.540
Tell me,

00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:30.219
Is this a marriage,

00:06:34.339 --> 00:06:35.620
Or merely a transaction?

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:03.860
Is this

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.219
Ground Snow?

00:07:07.819 --> 00:07:08.699
Look into it.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.500
Tingyun, there you are.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.060
What a righteous man.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:28.860
Last night,

00:07:29.019 --> 00:07:30.019
Mr. Zhao and I

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.060
Thrashed that scoundrel Zuo Junjie good.

00:07:32.259 --> 00:07:33.259
That Mr. Zhao

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:34.660
Has a chivalrous heart.

00:07:35.219 --> 00:07:37.060
He even stood up for you.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:38.540
Grandmother,

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.379
Uncle and Aunt have been misled

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.180
For the sake of their own gain.

00:07:42.819 --> 00:07:45.259
But what made you fall for Zhao Ling's tricks?

00:07:45.379 --> 00:07:47.180
Just because you two fought side by side once,

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.100
You become friends?

00:07:48.779 --> 00:07:51.139
Of course I only want you to have a good match.

00:07:51.459 --> 00:07:52.459
Mr. Zhao

00:07:52.459 --> 00:07:53.180
Is handsome and virtuous,

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:53.940
And has a noble birth.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.300
If trouble ever comes your way in the future,

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:57.740
He will surely keep you safe.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.139
He's truly

00:07:59.139 --> 00:08:00.540
An ideal husband.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.139
What a pity you are not a woman.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:04.980
If you were, you could marry him,

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:06.579
And it would be ideal for both sides.

00:08:11.899 --> 00:08:14.500
Why did you bring a magnolia sapling, Ninth Young Lady?

00:08:15.219 --> 00:08:16.100
I have taken

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:17.540
A fancy to you at first sight, Madam.

00:08:18.139 --> 00:08:20.139
There are many tangled outside affairs

00:08:20.259 --> 00:08:21.379
I cannot make sense of.

00:08:21.899 --> 00:08:24.100
I truly have no one to turn to for advice.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.180
What would you like to ask?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.699
I would like to ask

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.660
About Mr. Zhao.

00:08:33.739 --> 00:08:35.020
You're quite sharp-witted

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.180
To have come to me.

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:38.380
Have a seat.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.300
Salt administration

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.459
Bears heavily on people's livelihood,

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.260
And even more on military and state governance.

00:08:47.859 --> 00:08:49.380
Officials dispatched to oversee the work

00:08:49.459 --> 00:08:50.979
Are mostly high-ranking and powerful.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:52.859
If a salt shortage

00:08:52.859 --> 00:08:54.260
Escalates into a grain famine,

00:08:55.219 --> 00:08:57.300
Could a mere local Imperial Salt Censor

00:08:58.619 --> 00:09:00.260
Shoulder such grave responsibility?

00:09:01.619 --> 00:09:03.380
(He truly is a fraud.)

00:09:05.739 --> 00:09:06.579
Madam,

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:07.459
Didn't you say

00:09:07.459 --> 00:09:09.219
You'd stay out of the Fu family's affairs?

00:09:10.819 --> 00:09:12.260
The magnolia itself is splendid,

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.780
Yet its original pot

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.219
Is a burden.

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:21.540
I acted on impulse back then

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.020
And put her in a tough spot.

00:09:23.099 --> 00:09:24.699
So I offered her some guidance.

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:27.819
How much she can take to heart

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:30.579
Depends on her own fate.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.499
It is also a test for her.

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.260
My Lady,

00:09:36.339 --> 00:09:37.459
I've checked at the salt shop.

00:09:37.619 --> 00:09:38.739
It's the finest top-grade salt,

00:09:38.739 --> 00:09:39.339
Ground Snow.

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.219
All Ground Snow from Huaying

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.780
Was confiscated by Eldest Uncle.

00:09:49.499 --> 00:09:50.739
How could he still have any?

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.180
Aside from the Imperial Envoy,

00:09:56.219 --> 00:09:58.099
No one else can get Ground Snow.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:00.660
He is Jiuweijiao.

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.260
The eyebrow-height staff won't suit me.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.140
I'd rather wield a blade.

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:08.819
You want to wield a blade again?

00:10:09.339 --> 00:10:10.739
How many times have I told you?

00:10:11.099 --> 00:10:12.260
When roaming the jianghu,

00:10:12.699 --> 00:10:14.579
A few self-defense skills are all you need.

00:10:16.859 --> 00:10:18.660
Your hands have never been stained with blood.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.540
If you ever get the chance,

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.819
You can still choose the right path.

00:10:25.739 --> 00:10:26.859
I heard

00:10:26.859 --> 00:10:28.180
Feng Laosi, the salt merchant,

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:29.420
Has bad blood with Jiuweijiao.

00:10:29.859 --> 00:10:31.420
Why don't we turn the situation to our advantage?

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.020
We'll claim

00:10:33.099 --> 00:10:34.699
Jiuweijiao disguised himself as the Imperial Envoy

00:10:34.699 --> 00:10:35.579
And infiltrated the Fu family.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.619
We'll let someone else deal with the fraud for us.

00:10:39.499 --> 00:10:40.459
Mr. Zhao.

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.180
Miss Fu requests your presence.

00:10:42.339 --> 00:10:43.380
She has something important to discuss.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.260
What matter?

00:10:46.619 --> 00:10:48.660
It's regarding arranging funds for you.

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:52.859
Miss Fu

00:10:52.859 --> 00:10:54.739
Also wants to contribute to the fund raising.

00:10:54.739 --> 00:10:56.380
She hopes to ask you a few questions.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:58.859
Please go ahead.

00:10:59.459 --> 00:11:01.060
Mr. Zhao, have you ever seen

00:11:01.219 --> 00:11:02.380
Ten thousand taels of silver?

00:11:04.739 --> 00:11:05.979
How many chests would it fill?

00:11:12.979 --> 00:11:14.260
If two men carry one,

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.420
Can they manage it?

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.020
It's those two men.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.619
Who might these guests be?

00:11:30.219 --> 00:11:32.699
You are the Jiuweijiao spoken of across the jianghu.

00:11:33.499 --> 00:11:35.979
So you're nothing but a weak scholar.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:38.219
Take them down!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:40.579
Mr. Zhao,

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.300
We're badly outnumbered.

00:11:43.219 --> 00:11:44.619
That's the jianghu way. Run when you must.

00:11:45.579 --> 00:11:47.219
Only those who know when to run can survive the jianghu.

00:11:48.699 --> 00:11:49.219
Understood.

00:12:09.859 --> 00:12:11.339
Interesting.

00:12:11.979 --> 00:12:12.660
After them!

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:13.540
Don't let him escape!

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:14.619
Halt!

00:12:14.619 --> 00:12:15.219
Seize them!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:24.979
I closed the window.

00:12:24.979 --> 00:12:25.940
How did it open again?

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.180
What's this?

00:12:36.819 --> 00:12:37.780
My Lady.

00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:40.339
Ground Snow.

00:12:43.420 --> 00:12:44.579
What do we do, My Lady?

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:47.140
He'll come to seek revenge on us.

00:12:52.979 --> 00:12:54.579
(Ninth Young Lady, you seek a prestigious high-status marriage.)

00:12:54.699 --> 00:12:56.339
(Yet your family lacks the virtue worthy of such standing.)

00:12:56.339 --> 00:12:58.699
(Beware the fall from lofty hopes and empty dreams.)

00:12:59.099 --> 00:12:59.940
Scoundrel.

00:13:00.499 --> 00:13:01.420
My Lady,

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.300
What could he mean by this?

00:13:03.819 --> 00:13:05.099
(Fu Residence) Will he seek revenge on us?

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.300
Whatever his intentions may be,

00:13:06.859 --> 00:13:07.739
We only need

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.859
To capture him as soon as possible.

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:10.859
What

00:13:10.859 --> 00:13:11.940
About the salt?

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.499
Report this to the authorities.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.739
Offer a hefty reward for his capture.

00:13:20.979 --> 00:13:23.380
Claim he attempted to swindle ten thousand taels of silver.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:23.780
Understood.

00:13:23.979 --> 00:13:24.579
Wait.

00:13:25.819 --> 00:13:26.940
Change "attempted to swindle"

00:13:27.499 --> 00:13:28.660
To "swindled".

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.339
(Wanted Notice) Zhao Ling and his accomplice

00:13:33.339 --> 00:13:34.900
Infiltrated the Fu Residence in Huaying

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.020
And fraudulently obtained

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:37.859
Ten thousand taels of silver.

00:13:38.579 --> 00:13:40.380
Anyone who reports their whereabouts

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.859
Shall receive a reward of one hundred taels from the Fu family.

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:42.979
Whoever captures them

00:13:42.979 --> 00:13:43.979
Will be awarded one thousand taels.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.099
(Swindled?)

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.219
A thousand taels?

00:13:47.219 --> 00:13:47.979
That's a fortune!

00:13:49.339 --> 00:13:50.260
Make way!

00:13:50.819 --> 00:13:52.140
Who is Zhao Ling?

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.060
How dare he cheat the Fu family.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.020
Never seen him before.

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:00.979
My Lady,

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.060
Why did you change "attempted to swindle"

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.339
To "swindled"?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:07.579
All under heaven hustle,

00:14:07.579 --> 00:14:08.660
Drawn by gain.

00:14:09.020 --> 00:14:10.260
All under heaven bustle,

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.499
Chasing profit.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:12.979
Grandmother once said,

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:14.579
Those wanderers of the jianghu

00:14:14.739 --> 00:14:16.459
Claim loyalty and righteousness come first.

00:14:16.579 --> 00:14:17.099
Mr. Zhao.

00:14:17.099 --> 00:14:18.579
Yet in the end they still

00:14:19.099 --> 00:14:20.660
Cannot escape the lure of profit.

00:14:20.819 --> 00:14:21.540
This is

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.180
Human nature.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.739
We're all like brothers here.

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:26.660
Come and eat.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.140
It's not much.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:28.940
Mr. Zhao, you go first.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.060
Bao,

00:14:30.219 --> 00:14:31.900
When have you ever seen Mr. Zhao keep all the food to himself?

00:14:32.499 --> 00:14:33.099
Here.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.499
Let's eat together.

00:14:57.699 --> 00:14:59.339
You two haven't been with me long,

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.780
So you don't know one of my rules.

00:15:03.459 --> 00:15:04.979
Whoever prepares the meal

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.260
Takes the first bite.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:10.459
Only then can I eat in peace.

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:14.979
Go on, eat.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.140
You poisoned the food!

00:15:33.579 --> 00:15:34.699
Trying to run?

00:15:36.699 --> 00:15:37.300
Mr. Zhao.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.300
He must be punished.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:40.619
Mr. Zhao!

00:15:40.979 --> 00:15:42.420
Spare my life, Mr. Zhao!

00:15:42.819 --> 00:15:43.739
Mr. Zhao!

00:15:44.739 --> 00:15:45.540
Mr. Zhao!

00:15:49.819 --> 00:15:50.660
Mr. Zhao!

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.219
Do you know why

00:15:58.219 --> 00:15:59.219
I love red-stalk greens?

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.140
Wild greens like these grew everywhere in the old days.

00:16:02.099 --> 00:16:03.540
They were all we had to fill our bellies.

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.900
But you've only been with me a short while,

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.739
So there's no way you'd know my fondness for this dish.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.979
But why

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.979
Did you choose to poison this soup of all things?

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:21.459
Yuanbao,

00:16:22.459 --> 00:16:23.780
There is a kind of person in this world

00:16:25.339 --> 00:16:26.579
Who can only share hardship,

00:16:27.979 --> 00:16:29.099
Not prosperity.

00:16:33.099 --> 00:16:33.819
Prosperity?

00:16:36.819 --> 00:16:38.619
All these years by your side,

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.540
I've lived in constant fear.

00:16:41.579 --> 00:16:42.420
Where's the prosperity?

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.300
You believed that lie about the swindled silver?

00:16:46.859 --> 00:16:47.459
I did.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.459
I will make up

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.140
That five thousand taels to you.

00:17:02.859 --> 00:17:03.579
Leave now.

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:10.539
I've stuck with you all these years

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:12.860
Only for money.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.219
It's a deal.

00:17:26.699 --> 00:17:27.979
You, Chuan, and Biao

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.620
Head back to Yongning Prefecture first.

00:17:32.739 --> 00:17:33.459
Mr. Zhao,

00:17:33.979 --> 00:17:35.299
Are you staying here alone?

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.140
At first, I thought

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:38.940
If we lost that money,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.820
Then so be it.

00:17:43.779 --> 00:17:45.420
But after what happened today,

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:47.820
I can't just let this go.

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:51.180
Now that the label of "swindled"

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:52.779
Has been placed upon my shoulders,

00:17:54.299 --> 00:17:55.539
I won't bear it for nothing.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.019
No matter what it takes,

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.739
I will get the money back.

00:18:07.499 --> 00:18:09.660
(I live in a humble cottage of brick and clay,)

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:12.539
(while that young lady dwells in rich, ornate towers.)

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.259
(I dress plainly in black robes and white socks,)

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.420
(yet she adorns herself in vibrant reds and greens.)

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:19.580
(I stay alone in an empty chamber,)

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.940
(but she may seek a fine match,)

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:22.820
(and from now on,)

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.100
(will have company every single night.)

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.900
(Aren't we all flesh and blood,)

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:30.019
(walking within these courtyard walls?)

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.459
(They treat me this way)

00:18:33.539 --> 00:18:35.459
(only because I am lowly.)

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.860
(But what if)

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:41.539
(I hold their vital weaknesses in my grasp?)

00:18:42.979 --> 00:18:44.059
You wretch!

00:18:44.059 --> 00:18:45.180
Have you lost your mind?

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.620
You're a widow!

00:18:59.340 --> 00:18:59.940
You...

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.660
What do you want?

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:10.620
I want Tingyun.

00:19:12.979 --> 00:19:13.940
Grandmother,

00:19:14.299 --> 00:19:16.580
Tingyun is old enough to marry now.

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:18.219
My younger brother Junjie

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.499
Grew up right before our eyes.

00:19:20.499 --> 00:19:21.459
We know him through and through.

00:19:21.459 --> 00:19:22.940
He is diligent and eager to learn.

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:24.779
I beg you to grant them

00:19:24.779 --> 00:19:26.100
Your blessing for their marriage.

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:27.100
My sister-in-law,

00:19:28.979 --> 00:19:30.180
What

00:19:30.539 --> 00:19:32.219
Is all this fuss about?

00:19:32.539 --> 00:19:33.420
Tingyun

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.620
Is your niece after all.

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.140
How could you bear to do this?

00:19:37.779 --> 00:19:38.539
Well,

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:41.059
I speak

00:19:41.059 --> 00:19:42.259
Only for Tingyun's good.

00:19:42.739 --> 00:19:44.420
Two match proposals have fallen through.

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.180
First you sought a second-rank official,

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.420
Yet the Yu family turned you down.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.860
Then you found a censor,

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.380
Only to discover he was an impostor.

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:51.660
You...

00:19:52.219 --> 00:19:53.420
Would you really let the girl

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:54.779
Waste away her youth like this?

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:55.259
You...

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.140
Mother,

00:19:58.660 --> 00:19:59.860
Anyhow,

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:02.340
I will never consent to this marriage.

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:03.660
Alright,

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:06.140
Since you refuse,

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.660
We may as well ask Tingyun's will.

00:20:09.459 --> 00:20:11.180
She's grown up now.

00:20:11.539 --> 00:20:12.660
For all matters,

00:20:12.739 --> 00:20:14.180
She can make her own choices,

00:20:15.059 --> 00:20:16.940
Lest she scheme behind our backs,

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.420
And act first and report later.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:21.100
Take exposing Zhao Ling's fraud for example.

00:20:21.499 --> 00:20:22.900
If she disliked the match,

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.660
She could have spoken to her elders.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.739
Instead, she brought outsiders to stir trouble at home,

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:28.580
Making us a laughingstock.

00:20:28.699 --> 00:20:29.539
Who, in this household,

00:20:29.539 --> 00:20:30.620
Holds the authority?

00:20:35.499 --> 00:20:36.539
Still, that incident

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:38.219
Is Zhao Ling's fault,

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.140
Not Tingyun's.

00:20:41.779 --> 00:20:42.940
Grandmother!

00:20:43.979 --> 00:20:45.019
Grandmother.

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:48.499
Life as a widow is unbearable.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:51.140
I can barely hold on any longer.

00:20:51.420 --> 00:20:53.580
I need something to hope for.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.219
If Tingyun marries into the Zuo family,

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:57.739
No matter how many more years I endure,

00:20:58.180 --> 00:20:58.900
I swear

00:20:59.059 --> 00:21:01.660
I will bring honor to the Fu family by remaining chaste.

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.019
What are you saying?

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.699
People are living beings,

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:08.499
Yet memorial arches are lifeless stone.

00:21:09.259 --> 00:21:11.019
Is my own daughter

00:21:11.739 --> 00:21:13.620
Worth less than a mere arch?

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:15.180
Sister-in-law,

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:16.380
Our family's honor

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.340
Rests on these chastity arches.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:20.860
Look at Zuo.

00:21:21.299 --> 00:21:23.100
If she causes any trouble,

00:21:23.779 --> 00:21:25.620
It will ruin not one chastity memorial arch,

00:21:25.620 --> 00:21:26.900
But four!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:36.860
Madam Yu has arrived.

00:21:44.779 --> 00:21:45.699
Madam Yu.

00:21:47.739 --> 00:21:48.820
What's going on here?

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:50.860
Have I come at a bad time?

00:21:51.299 --> 00:21:53.100
Madam, you've come at just the right moment.

00:21:53.259 --> 00:21:54.380
Please take a seat.

00:22:07.539 --> 00:22:08.580
This poor girl

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:10.259
Dreamed last night

00:22:10.259 --> 00:22:12.499
Of her beloved late husband.

00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:13.979
She cried bitterly.

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.219
She was just pouring out her heart to me.

00:22:16.979 --> 00:22:18.259
Poor girl.

00:22:18.259 --> 00:22:19.100
Stand up.

00:22:24.979 --> 00:22:26.100
Grandmother is right.

00:22:26.499 --> 00:22:27.539
My late husband appeared to me in a dream.

00:22:27.739 --> 00:22:29.420
He doted on Tingyun from childhood.

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:30.499
He cannot bear the thought of her marrying far away.

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:33.380
He bade me do all I can to keep her close by.

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:35.259
I beg you to grant your blessing, Grandmother.

00:22:35.779 --> 00:22:36.580
Tingyun

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:38.820
Is the Zuo family's only choice.

00:22:39.739 --> 00:22:40.699
We'll talk

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:42.620
Of this later.

00:22:43.059 --> 00:22:44.180
You may withdraw first.

00:22:44.699 --> 00:22:45.779
Look how tearful you are.

00:22:45.779 --> 00:22:46.940
How can you receive guests?

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:51.180
No need to trouble yourselves.

00:22:51.979 --> 00:22:53.820
It seems I truly came at an awkward hour.

00:22:54.219 --> 00:22:55.459
I shall speak my piece and take my leave.

00:22:56.059 --> 00:22:56.900
Earlier,

00:22:56.979 --> 00:22:58.259
I had servants move the bed

00:22:58.259 --> 00:22:59.420
To the west wing.

00:22:59.860 --> 00:23:01.739
Yet Jingxiu could not rest easy there.

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:03.019
So I thought to myself,

00:23:03.259 --> 00:23:04.459
"I ought to shift the bed

00:23:04.699 --> 00:23:06.219
Back to the east wing instead."

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:10.779
Old Madam Fu,

00:23:10.979 --> 00:23:11.940
Fifth Madam Fu,

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:13.620
Do you understand

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:15.019
What lies in my heart?

00:23:18.019 --> 00:23:18.820
Madam Yu.

00:23:19.100 --> 00:23:20.420
Your family is a noble house.

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:22.340
You could find any daughter-in-law you wish.

00:23:22.340 --> 00:23:23.499
Tingyun has a headstrong temper,

00:23:23.499 --> 00:23:24.340
And shows no respect to her elders.

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:25.940
Only my younger brother would take her without disdain.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:28.259
Are you out of your mind?

00:23:35.539 --> 00:23:37.219
A fine young lady attracts suitors from a hundred homes.

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:41.299
Ninth Young Lady is blessed with both virtue and wisdom,

00:23:41.499 --> 00:23:42.699
Fit to bring peace and prosperity to any household.

00:23:42.979 --> 00:23:45.059
I hold genuine affection for her.

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:49.779
Old Madam Fu,

00:23:49.779 --> 00:23:50.580
Fifth Madam Fu,

00:23:51.100 --> 00:23:52.539
If you see fit to consent,

00:23:52.539 --> 00:23:54.140
Send word to me at your earliest convenience.

00:23:54.140 --> 00:23:55.860
I will send a letter to the capital straight away

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:57.539
To settle this marriage proposal.

00:23:58.539 --> 00:23:59.459
Very well.

00:24:00.019 --> 00:24:00.660
Farewell.

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:03.979
Madam Yu.

00:24:04.259 --> 00:24:05.019
Madam Yu.

00:24:05.019 --> 00:24:05.459
Madam...

00:24:08.940 --> 00:24:09.620
Mother,

00:24:09.979 --> 00:24:10.860
Please help me.

00:24:11.219 --> 00:24:12.019
Mother.

00:24:12.620 --> 00:24:14.059
- Mother, please help me. - Someone.

00:24:14.499 --> 00:24:16.340
Drag this vile woman to the ancestral hall,

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:18.739
And leave her there to fend for herself.

00:24:19.019 --> 00:24:19.699
Mother!

00:24:20.699 --> 00:24:21.620
Mother!

00:24:21.620 --> 00:24:22.860
Mother, please help me.

00:24:22.860 --> 00:24:23.299
Move!

00:24:23.499 --> 00:24:24.420
Mother!

00:24:28.340 --> 00:24:30.219
I renounce

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:32.259
The fourth memorial arch.

00:24:33.900 --> 00:24:36.539
(This betrothal to the Yu family)

00:24:37.059 --> 00:24:38.459
(shall secure)

00:24:38.459 --> 00:24:40.019
(our family's future.)

00:24:43.059 --> 00:24:43.860
Hurry up.

00:24:43.860 --> 00:24:44.340
Move.

00:24:44.459 --> 00:24:45.699
Seal everything off completely.

00:24:47.140 --> 00:24:48.100
My Lady,

00:24:48.180 --> 00:24:49.340
It's pouring rain.

00:24:49.340 --> 00:24:50.779
What brings you to such a place?

00:24:50.940 --> 00:24:52.979
You ought to head back, My Lady.

00:24:54.299 --> 00:24:56.739
This foul, unholy place is no fit spot for you.

00:24:56.820 --> 00:24:58.059
Please return at once.

00:25:01.420 --> 00:25:01.820
Well...

00:25:10.499 --> 00:25:13.259
When I first married into this household,

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:16.739
I only cared for the eighty taels of betrothal silver

00:25:17.380 --> 00:25:19.340
And three taels of monthly stipend.

00:25:20.219 --> 00:25:22.019
I truly thought

00:25:22.380 --> 00:25:24.499
Being a widow was well worth it.

00:25:25.340 --> 00:25:26.900
Yet by the third year,

00:25:27.979 --> 00:25:29.140
I could bear it no longer.

00:25:29.739 --> 00:25:30.860
I begged to dissolve the marriage,

00:25:30.860 --> 00:25:31.900
To return to my home.

00:25:32.739 --> 00:25:34.259
(Fu Family Academy) Grandmother then sent servants

00:25:35.180 --> 00:25:37.140
To fetch my younger brother to keep me company.

00:25:38.059 --> 00:25:39.620
She enrolled him in the clan school,

00:25:39.820 --> 00:25:41.739
Promising him a bright future.

00:25:42.900 --> 00:25:44.580
So I thought it was a fair trade.

00:25:45.779 --> 00:25:47.459
But my brother

00:25:48.660 --> 00:25:50.580
Was never cut out for studying.

00:25:51.180 --> 00:25:52.580
By the fifth year,

00:25:53.420 --> 00:25:55.219
It was clear he would never pass the imperial exams.

00:25:55.979 --> 00:25:57.459
Regret gnawed at me again.

00:26:01.380 --> 00:26:03.340
Then Grandmother made me another vow.

00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:06.459
Every year at the Flower Goddess Festival,

00:26:07.380 --> 00:26:09.019
I would preside over the rituals.

00:26:09.820 --> 00:26:12.019
She said it would let me stand in the limelight

00:26:12.779 --> 00:26:13.699
To ease my loneliness.

00:26:19.180 --> 00:26:20.299
How foolish I was.

00:26:22.660 --> 00:26:24.420
I actually believed her words.

00:26:24.940 --> 00:26:27.660
I actually thought I had a place in this family.

00:26:29.019 --> 00:26:30.860
But in this family,

00:26:35.299 --> 00:26:38.059
Not a single soul truly holds me in regard.

00:26:40.019 --> 00:26:40.940
If they did,

00:26:46.739 --> 00:26:48.620
Why would they begrudge my brother

00:26:48.620 --> 00:26:50.459
A Fu young lady?

00:26:54.299 --> 00:26:55.100
Zuo.

00:26:56.539 --> 00:26:59.059
You once held me on your lap and played with me.

00:27:00.019 --> 00:27:02.019
But as your temper grew bitter and twisted,

00:27:02.940 --> 00:27:04.259
You came to loathe me more and more.

00:27:05.059 --> 00:27:07.100
I am not the cause of all your suffering.

00:27:07.940 --> 00:27:09.499
Why must you fixate your hatred on me?

00:27:11.820 --> 00:27:13.219
Through endless lonely nights,

00:27:13.739 --> 00:27:15.259
Ten years of my youth,

00:27:16.459 --> 00:27:17.499
All I earned

00:27:18.299 --> 00:27:21.059
Was nothing but praise for the Fu family's pure moral code.

00:27:23.539 --> 00:27:25.140
So when your marriage was being arranged,

00:27:27.180 --> 00:27:29.180
They added a generous entry

00:27:29.860 --> 00:27:31.420
To your dowry inventory.

00:27:49.900 --> 00:27:51.539
They used my betrothal

00:27:52.259 --> 00:27:54.180
To smooth the path for your match,

00:27:55.499 --> 00:27:57.219
Then leveraged your marriage

00:28:00.739 --> 00:28:03.499
To further the Fu family's rise in the bureaucracy.

00:28:04.380 --> 00:28:05.860
Do you truly believe Grandmother

00:28:07.380 --> 00:28:09.380
Plans for you out of genuine care?

00:28:10.340 --> 00:28:11.979
She only coaxes you

00:28:13.180 --> 00:28:15.019
Into blind obedience.

00:28:21.299 --> 00:28:22.420
Don't believe a word she says.

00:28:23.180 --> 00:28:24.820
Old Madam has always doted on you most.

00:28:26.100 --> 00:28:27.140
She speaks such words

00:28:28.340 --> 00:28:30.259
Only to grieve your heart.

00:28:31.140 --> 00:28:33.100
It was so close, just a hair's breadth away.

00:28:34.779 --> 00:28:36.940
That cursed Madam Yu.

00:28:38.660 --> 00:28:40.539
It was only barely out of my grasp.

00:28:44.620 --> 00:28:47.820
Yet that old hag seized the opportunity in the end.

00:28:51.900 --> 00:28:53.739
We are cut from the same cloth.

00:28:54.059 --> 00:28:56.019
Why do you bloom like a magnolia on the branch,

00:28:56.019 --> 00:28:58.259
While I am but mud beneath your feet?

00:29:02.420 --> 00:29:03.100
Hurry!

00:29:03.100 --> 00:29:03.820
Stop her!

00:29:03.940 --> 00:29:04.900
Hold her back!

00:29:05.699 --> 00:29:06.979
Have you lost your wits?

00:29:06.979 --> 00:29:08.059
Crazy woman!

00:29:08.219 --> 00:29:09.259
Let go of me!

00:29:09.699 --> 00:29:10.739
Let me go.

00:29:10.900 --> 00:29:11.779
Are you all right?

00:29:13.299 --> 00:29:15.219
What a loyal hound you are.

00:29:15.739 --> 00:29:16.860
So eager to defend your lady.

00:29:17.620 --> 00:29:19.380
Has she fulfilled your wish,

00:29:19.739 --> 00:29:21.699
Matching you up with Fu Tingzhuo?

00:29:22.739 --> 00:29:25.180
How are you any different from my brother?

00:29:25.499 --> 00:29:26.380
Do you truly think

00:29:26.380 --> 00:29:27.340
That meekly obeying every order,

00:29:27.340 --> 00:29:28.259
Letting others manipulate you,

00:29:28.259 --> 00:29:29.699
Will earn you a share of the spoils?

00:29:30.059 --> 00:29:31.180
Don't delude yourself.

00:29:31.380 --> 00:29:32.380
In the Fu family's eyes...

00:29:32.380 --> 00:29:33.019
Watch your tongue!

00:29:33.019 --> 00:29:35.180
You're merely another Zuo Junjie.

00:29:35.539 --> 00:29:36.779
Even your father,

00:29:36.779 --> 00:29:37.940
A renowned great scholar,

00:29:38.019 --> 00:29:39.380
Has served the Fu family for over a decade,

00:29:39.380 --> 00:29:41.219
Yet he is no more than an extra entry

00:29:41.219 --> 00:29:42.219
Added to her dowry inventory.

00:29:48.340 --> 00:29:49.180
Yake.

00:29:59.140 --> 00:30:00.019
Drag her away.

00:30:00.380 --> 00:30:01.140
My Lady,

00:30:01.140 --> 00:30:01.779
Miss Fan,

00:30:01.900 --> 00:30:03.580
Please hurry back to your chambers.

00:30:03.860 --> 00:30:04.660
- Let go! - Get up.

00:30:05.019 --> 00:30:05.979
Don't leave.

00:30:06.420 --> 00:30:07.499
Don't go.

00:30:07.860 --> 00:30:09.140
Drag her inside at once!

00:30:09.259 --> 00:30:09.900
Shut the door!

00:30:09.979 --> 00:30:11.219
Nail it firmly shut!

00:30:11.860 --> 00:30:12.739
Hurry, let's go.

00:30:23.259 --> 00:30:24.100
A big world

00:30:24.100 --> 00:30:25.499
Brings all kinds of people.

00:30:25.779 --> 00:30:26.900
Madam Zuo should remember

00:30:26.900 --> 00:30:28.259
Where her brother comes from.

00:30:28.459 --> 00:30:29.900
He only stands thanks to the family's support.

00:30:29.900 --> 00:30:31.299
Yet he acts as if he belongs here,

00:30:31.380 --> 00:30:33.420
Reaching far above his station for the Ninth Young Lady.

00:30:40.299 --> 00:30:41.219
(Above his station?)

00:30:41.820 --> 00:30:43.539
(I brought two pots of narcissus today.)

00:30:44.219 --> 00:30:45.539
(When you see him,)

00:30:45.900 --> 00:30:47.140
(you could give him one.)

00:30:59.580 --> 00:31:00.380
Where is she?

00:31:03.660 --> 00:31:05.219
She was here just a moment ago.

00:31:17.940 --> 00:31:18.820
Tell me,

00:31:20.459 --> 00:31:22.620
Was Moxiang just insulting Zuo Junjie,

00:31:24.140 --> 00:31:25.219
Or was it me?

00:31:26.860 --> 00:31:28.499
The Ninth Young Lady went too far.

00:31:29.100 --> 00:31:31.059
You even took a hit from that hairpin for her, Miss,

00:31:31.180 --> 00:31:32.499
Yet she did nothing for you.

00:31:35.420 --> 00:31:36.940
She must think I am unworthy too.

00:31:39.219 --> 00:31:41.660
Everyone calls me another Zuo Junjie.

00:31:44.019 --> 00:31:45.580
Even she sees me the same way.

00:31:59.699 --> 00:32:01.100
Mr. Yu, you work far too hard.

00:32:01.420 --> 00:32:02.779
Madam will grow worried if you stay any later.

00:32:03.820 --> 00:32:04.499
It is fine.

00:32:04.860 --> 00:32:06.539
I was fully engrossed in discussion with Master Fan.

00:32:06.820 --> 00:32:07.860
Words flowed freely,

00:32:07.979 --> 00:32:08.860
And I had to speak my mind.

00:32:13.219 --> 00:32:14.499
Where did this potted flower come from?

00:32:17.660 --> 00:32:18.900
I reckon no one wants it.

00:32:20.940 --> 00:32:22.059
I find it quite elegant.

00:32:24.059 --> 00:32:25.900
Most plants grow in soil,

00:32:26.340 --> 00:32:27.580
Yet this one thrives in water.

00:32:28.420 --> 00:32:29.900
It holds an air of pure, refined charm.

00:32:31.059 --> 00:32:31.979
Fetch a new vessel,

00:32:32.660 --> 00:32:33.660
And bring it back to tend to.

00:32:34.340 --> 00:32:34.779
Understood.

00:32:40.219 --> 00:32:40.699
Wait.

00:32:41.340 --> 00:32:42.219
What are you doing?

00:32:42.820 --> 00:32:43.779
Mr. Yu,

00:32:43.779 --> 00:32:45.380
Madam specially sent for servants from the Fu family

00:32:45.380 --> 00:32:46.860
To move the bed back to the east.

00:32:52.940 --> 00:32:54.340
It was moved from east to west,

00:32:56.340 --> 00:32:57.860
Then west back to east again.

00:32:58.380 --> 00:33:00.860
I cannot even decide where my own bed shall be placed.

00:33:11.420 --> 00:33:12.140
Yake,

00:33:12.860 --> 00:33:13.900
Are you all right?

00:33:16.699 --> 00:33:18.259
I never gave your daffodils

00:33:20.860 --> 00:33:22.620
To Tingzhuo.

00:33:23.620 --> 00:33:25.420
You know Grandmother's temper.

00:33:25.580 --> 00:33:27.219
She values family honor and tradition above all else.

00:33:28.620 --> 00:33:30.180
I feared if I acted rashly,

00:33:30.180 --> 00:33:31.539
It would only backfire.

00:33:34.459 --> 00:33:35.860
You've misread me, Tingyun.

00:33:37.140 --> 00:33:38.699
That was never my intention.

00:33:39.660 --> 00:33:41.299
Your family has shown me kindness for years.

00:33:43.380 --> 00:33:44.539
That pot of daffodils

00:33:45.059 --> 00:33:46.979
Was merely a small token of thanks.

00:33:47.779 --> 00:33:49.660
I give such gifts to more than just Seventh Young Master,

00:33:51.660 --> 00:33:53.420
Let alone to express secret feelings through flowers.

00:33:57.019 --> 00:33:57.699
(Fu Family Academy) Master Fan,

00:33:58.259 --> 00:33:59.380
I have a question,

00:33:59.660 --> 00:34:00.860
But I cannot seem to find an answer.

00:34:01.459 --> 00:34:02.580
May I ask for your guidance?

00:34:03.499 --> 00:34:04.259
What is it?

00:34:04.620 --> 00:34:05.459
It is often said

00:34:06.059 --> 00:34:07.259
That filial piety stands foremost among all virtues.

00:34:08.619 --> 00:34:09.499
As a son,

00:34:10.179 --> 00:34:12.380
One ought to heed all his mother's instructions.

00:34:14.340 --> 00:34:15.139
Yet suppose

00:34:16.260 --> 00:34:17.300
There is a matter

00:34:18.459 --> 00:34:20.220
On which the son wishes to go against his mother's will.

00:34:21.900 --> 00:34:23.179
Does that make him unfilial?

00:34:24.900 --> 00:34:25.780
(Fan Shen, a Renowned Scholar) It depends

00:34:26.220 --> 00:34:27.420
On the matter in question.

00:34:27.979 --> 00:34:28.740
If trivial,

00:34:28.740 --> 00:34:29.539
It is not worth dwelling on.

00:34:29.979 --> 00:34:30.940
It is...

00:34:32.979 --> 00:34:34.059
The important matter of marriage.

00:34:37.179 --> 00:34:38.780
Suppose the bride Mother chooses

00:34:40.340 --> 00:34:41.820
Is not to the son's liking, what then?

00:34:43.900 --> 00:34:44.659
Yake.

00:34:46.179 --> 00:34:47.220
Suppose in the future

00:34:47.539 --> 00:34:48.780
The husband I pick for you

00:34:48.780 --> 00:34:49.820
Fails to win your heart,

00:34:50.420 --> 00:34:51.340
What would you do?

00:34:52.300 --> 00:34:53.900
Who have you chosen for me?

00:34:55.019 --> 00:34:56.579
I'm merely speaking hypothetically.

00:34:57.139 --> 00:34:58.860
A student came to consult me on this question.

00:35:02.459 --> 00:35:03.459
The answer is plain to see.

00:35:03.900 --> 00:35:05.619
Empress Lv forced her son Emperor Hui of Han

00:35:05.619 --> 00:35:07.340
To wed her niece Zhang Yan.

00:35:07.659 --> 00:35:09.900
Afterwards, the Emperor doted solely on a palace maid

00:35:10.380 --> 00:35:11.499
And passed away young from melancholy.

00:35:12.499 --> 00:35:14.420
Emperor Hui bore no dislike toward Zhang Yan herself.

00:35:14.900 --> 00:35:16.539
He merely resented his mother.

00:35:17.579 --> 00:35:18.659
No wonder.

00:35:19.539 --> 00:35:21.099
His question was never about marriage,

00:35:22.300 --> 00:35:23.539
But about filial piety.

00:35:27.659 --> 00:35:28.700
I wonder which young master

00:35:28.700 --> 00:35:29.940
Would share

00:35:30.179 --> 00:35:32.420
Such private matters with an outsider.

00:35:33.820 --> 00:35:34.860
Who else could it be?

00:35:36.179 --> 00:35:37.740
There is only one young man

00:35:38.820 --> 00:35:39.740
Whose marriage is being discussed.

00:35:40.059 --> 00:35:41.539
Could it be Mr. Yu?

00:35:42.539 --> 00:35:44.260
Tingyun curries favor with Madam Yu,

00:35:45.499 --> 00:35:46.900
Yet shuns Mr. Yu.

00:35:48.460 --> 00:35:49.840
(Fu Family Academy)

00:35:58.780 --> 00:35:59.380
Master Fan?

00:36:14.420 --> 00:36:16.139
I grew them without much thought.

00:36:17.059 --> 00:36:18.940
No need to examine them so closely, Young Master.

00:36:21.860 --> 00:36:22.740
Forgive my rudeness, Miss.

00:36:22.860 --> 00:36:23.579
No matter.

00:36:27.300 --> 00:36:28.900
I came to bring Father his meal.

00:36:29.979 --> 00:36:30.900
I shall leave after setting it down.

00:36:41.380 --> 00:36:42.979
Are you fond of flowers, Young Master?

00:36:44.139 --> 00:36:45.099
Not exactly.

00:36:46.780 --> 00:36:47.860
It was merely a coincidence.

00:36:48.579 --> 00:36:50.019
I picked up a pot the other day.

00:36:51.619 --> 00:36:52.940
It's grown the very same way.

00:36:53.579 --> 00:36:55.659
Could this flower belong to Miss Fan?

00:36:56.539 --> 00:36:58.539
In the entire Huaying,

00:36:58.619 --> 00:36:59.820
Only she grows flowers

00:36:59.940 --> 00:37:00.860
In water.

00:37:01.700 --> 00:37:03.300
If you take a fancy to it,

00:37:03.940 --> 00:37:04.979
You may take it.

00:37:05.820 --> 00:37:07.019
Tend to it well.

00:37:07.979 --> 00:37:08.619
Miss,

00:37:08.740 --> 00:37:10.780
Narcissus is your given name.

00:37:23.099 --> 00:37:24.139
Greetings, Madam Yu.

00:37:24.740 --> 00:37:25.900
At the Flower Goddess Festival,

00:37:26.139 --> 00:37:27.499
I am grateful for your kindness, Madam.

00:37:28.139 --> 00:37:29.539
You gifted me a smooth jade bracelet.

00:37:30.340 --> 00:37:31.579
I have no worthy repayment to offer.

00:37:32.059 --> 00:37:33.579
I stitched an aromatic sachet with care.

00:37:33.700 --> 00:37:34.820
Please forgive

00:37:35.260 --> 00:37:36.340
This humble offering, Madam.

00:37:37.499 --> 00:37:39.499
I've heard you excel at gardening.

00:37:40.220 --> 00:37:41.579
I invited you here today

00:37:41.659 --> 00:37:43.220
To seek your advice.

00:37:43.700 --> 00:37:44.740
Where is the best place

00:37:44.979 --> 00:37:46.420
To grow narcissus?

00:37:49.340 --> 00:37:50.820
Narcissus...

00:37:53.139 --> 00:37:55.260
Narcissus dislikes prolonged sunlight.

00:37:55.499 --> 00:37:56.579
The water must stay clean.

00:37:56.900 --> 00:37:58.139
Otherwise its roots will rot.

00:37:59.300 --> 00:38:00.940
Truly, the water must remain pure.

00:38:02.220 --> 00:38:03.740
Just as one's heart ought to stay untainted.

00:38:05.380 --> 00:38:07.059
May you be like this narcissus,

00:38:07.340 --> 00:38:09.099
Blooming gracefully, never seeking praise.

00:38:09.420 --> 00:38:10.340
Miss Fan,

00:38:10.420 --> 00:38:11.459
What do you think?

00:38:16.420 --> 00:38:17.700
Narcissus is delicate and fussy.

00:38:18.260 --> 00:38:20.099
I fear it does not suit the Yu family.

00:38:20.860 --> 00:38:21.979
You had better take it back,

00:38:21.979 --> 00:38:23.539
And tend to it yourself.

00:38:27.019 --> 00:38:29.179
The jade bracelet I gave you is fine quality.

00:38:29.740 --> 00:38:31.579
You need not trouble yourself with gifts in return.

00:38:32.099 --> 00:38:33.539
By the time

00:38:33.700 --> 00:38:34.900
You find a rare trinket as this,

00:38:35.619 --> 00:38:37.619
My son will likely have passed the imperial exam.

00:38:39.820 --> 00:38:41.499
Madam Yu lacks the insight to see its worth.

00:38:41.619 --> 00:38:44.220
She fails to see all the care you put into this sachet.

00:38:51.179 --> 00:38:52.179
Tell me.

00:38:54.499 --> 00:38:56.659
Tingyun's hairpin stirs wicks often,

00:38:57.740 --> 00:38:58.940
Yet it never tarnishes.

00:39:00.300 --> 00:39:02.019
Mine, though, has faded like this.

00:39:02.220 --> 00:39:03.619
True gold fears no fire.

00:39:03.860 --> 00:39:04.900
The Ninth Young Lady

00:39:04.900 --> 00:39:06.099
Must wear a golden hairpin.

00:39:06.619 --> 00:39:07.099
Indeed.

00:39:09.780 --> 00:39:11.860
Silver is inherently lesser than gold.

00:39:13.820 --> 00:39:16.260
No wonder Madam Zuo laments the unfairness of this world.

00:39:17.139 --> 00:39:19.099
Tingyun is a golden hairpin by birth,

00:39:20.740 --> 00:39:22.099
While I am only silver.

00:39:24.019 --> 00:39:26.300
Without elevating my station through marriage,

00:39:27.619 --> 00:39:28.820
I shall never earn

00:39:31.300 --> 00:39:32.619
Genuine respect from others.

00:39:36.860 --> 00:39:38.499
There will be a poetry gathering in a few days.

00:39:39.300 --> 00:39:41.179
Old Madam Fu and I have come to an agreement.

00:39:41.619 --> 00:39:43.340
You shall meet Ninth Young Lady there.

00:39:43.940 --> 00:39:45.459
You must present this poem then,

00:39:45.459 --> 00:39:46.579
And claim the top prize.

00:39:46.820 --> 00:39:48.740
Two champions shall form a match.

00:39:48.979 --> 00:39:50.499
It would be a lovely tale to tell.

00:40:21.260 --> 00:40:21.860
Mr. Zhao.

00:40:21.979 --> 00:40:22.700
It's me.

00:40:23.940 --> 00:40:24.820
What are you doing here?

00:40:26.099 --> 00:40:27.420
Didn't I order you to be sent off?

00:40:28.820 --> 00:40:30.579
How could I leave you all alone?

00:40:30.579 --> 00:40:31.820
So I slipped back.

00:40:32.019 --> 00:40:33.539
Who's really worried about who?

00:40:33.780 --> 00:40:34.380
How old am I?

00:40:34.380 --> 00:40:35.019
And how old are you?

00:40:35.420 --> 00:40:36.220
Enough of this.

00:40:38.579 --> 00:40:39.740
Just finish this one errand.

00:40:42.380 --> 00:40:43.539
There will be an event here shortly,

00:40:44.380 --> 00:40:45.700
A poetry gathering.

00:40:57.780 --> 00:40:58.539
Where's the censer?

00:40:59.139 --> 00:40:59.940
Over there.

00:41:00.300 --> 00:41:00.940
Bring it over.

00:41:10.659 --> 00:41:11.780
Don't let go, My Lady.

00:41:11.979 --> 00:41:13.179
When Mr. Yu draws near,

00:41:13.300 --> 00:41:14.579
Waft the incense scent toward him.

00:41:18.380 --> 00:41:21.700
Greetings, Madam Yu and Old Madam Fu.

00:41:27.780 --> 00:41:30.059
Once you enter today's poetry gathering,

00:41:30.420 --> 00:41:32.220
All blossoms will pale in comparison.

00:41:32.420 --> 00:41:33.780
Not to mention Mr. Yu,

00:41:33.900 --> 00:41:35.179
Even the finest noble households

00:41:35.179 --> 00:41:35.860
Would be fortunate to have you.

00:41:37.099 --> 00:41:38.059
Enough of your flattery.

00:41:41.459 --> 00:41:42.659
Insolent! Where are you from?

00:41:42.659 --> 00:41:43.619
Have you no sense?

00:41:44.499 --> 00:41:45.179
Let it be.

00:42:06.700 --> 00:42:07.499
Stay quiet.

00:42:11.179 --> 00:42:12.420
I've come to strike a deal

00:42:12.860 --> 00:42:14.179
With you, Ninth Young Lady.

00:42:14.340 --> 00:42:15.260
My Lady.

00:42:15.260 --> 00:42:17.019
Your family owes me ten thousand taels for the salt trade.

00:42:19.260 --> 00:42:20.860
Would you do me a kindness

00:42:21.459 --> 00:42:22.539
And gather the sum for me?

00:42:23.979 --> 00:42:25.740
Weren't you so powerful before?

00:42:27.579 --> 00:42:28.979
Take me if you must.

00:42:29.740 --> 00:42:31.380
My lady and I share a deep bond.

00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:32.940
She would never abandon me.

00:42:32.940 --> 00:42:34.380
She will surely pay the ransom for me.

00:42:34.499 --> 00:42:35.740
She is merely a maid.

00:42:38.220 --> 00:42:39.300
She's not worth such a sum.

00:42:39.700 --> 00:42:40.700
My Lady.

00:42:41.260 --> 00:42:42.420
Leave me here.

00:42:43.059 --> 00:42:44.220
Send her to gather the money.

00:42:45.619 --> 00:42:47.300
Quit playing tricks on me.

00:42:47.940 --> 00:42:49.740
I want those silver notes right now.

00:42:51.139 --> 00:42:52.019
At once.

00:42:53.459 --> 00:42:54.179
Yuwei.

00:43:01.420 --> 00:43:02.659
I shall go raise the funds at once.

00:43:02.740 --> 00:43:03.459
But there is one request.

00:43:03.740 --> 00:43:05.459
I beg you, sir, do not make a commotion.

00:43:06.059 --> 00:43:07.220
My lady

00:43:07.499 --> 00:43:08.619
Is in talks of a marriage match.

00:43:09.099 --> 00:43:11.380
If anyone finds her alone in a room with an unrelated man,

00:43:11.740 --> 00:43:13.619
Her entire life will be ruined.

00:43:16.659 --> 00:43:18.659
It all depends on how quickly you can get the money.

00:43:44.288 --> 00:43:46.640
(Next Episode)

00:43:48.019 --> 00:43:48.900
My Lady,

00:43:49.340 --> 00:43:50.340
Old Madam Fu

00:43:50.340 --> 00:43:51.940
Will let us leave safely, right?

00:43:52.260 --> 00:43:54.099
If the charge of adultery sticks to me,

00:43:55.059 --> 00:43:56.979
The three chastity memorial arches standing before the Fu Residence

00:43:56.979 --> 00:43:57.820
Will all crumble.

00:43:58.499 --> 00:43:59.979
This concerns the Fu family's reputation.

00:44:00.539 --> 00:44:01.499
It won't be that simple.

00:44:02.499 --> 00:44:04.099
All ancestors awarded chastity arches,

00:44:04.659 --> 00:44:06.940
Along with widows maintaining their chastity now,

00:44:07.539 --> 00:44:09.099
Have come to demand an explanation.

00:44:10.579 --> 00:44:11.740
As for Ninth Young Lady's disgrace,

00:44:12.019 --> 00:44:14.179
A decision must be made at once.

00:44:14.579 --> 00:44:15.619
(Eight-Character Slip) What

00:44:16.059 --> 00:44:17.539
Becomes of this girl

00:44:17.940 --> 00:44:19.979
Is entirely up to you, Madam.

00:44:32.121 --> 00:44:36.441
♪The past brushes by like a falling leaf♪

00:44:40.041 --> 00:44:44.401
♪So light, yet my steps still pause for you♪

00:44:46.521 --> 00:44:51.161
♪Through every rise and fall, our memories remain without regret♪

00:44:51.401 --> 00:44:54.201
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

00:44:55.361 --> 00:45:00.001
♪How I wish I could stay a little longer, but I can't♪

00:45:03.201 --> 00:45:10.041
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill my eyes with tears♪

00:45:10.921 --> 00:45:17.441
♪Etched deep within my heart, yet buried without a word♪

00:45:18.401 --> 00:45:21.841
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:45:22.361 --> 00:45:26.561
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:45:26.841 --> 00:45:32.521
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

00:45:44.641 --> 00:45:48.521
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you in the crowd♪

00:45:52.441 --> 00:45:56.441
♪Without a word, you lit up half my life♪

00:45:58.161 --> 00:46:02.841
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

00:46:03.161 --> 00:46:05.841
♪Kept close within my heart♪

00:46:06.921 --> 00:46:11.761
♪From now on, no one else is worth waiting for♪

00:46:15.281 --> 00:46:22.201
♪I turn away, afraid no one will ever come home to me again♪

00:46:23.081 --> 00:46:29.561
♪If we can build our future together, no storm can chill my heart♪

00:46:30.441 --> 00:46:33.961
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

00:46:34.401 --> 00:46:38.761
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

00:46:38.961 --> 00:46:44.681
♪One promise for a lifetime, echoing long after we part♪

